      <Node Name="GlobeWindow" Bounds="100,220" Id="VBrh8tKkQ1kPaTaEgq0sJb" Summary="A window that shows a globe. The mouse moves it." Remarks="Connect OpenStreetMap to Input: left drag moves the globe, the wheel zooms, right drag turns and tilts.&#xD;&#xA;More layers (VectorTiles, FeatureLayer, Geometry, more tiles) through Group: leftmost at the bottom.&#xD;&#xA;Camera: a GlobeCamera, to start somewhere else or to share the view; unconnected, the window keeps its own.&#xD;&#xA;Scene: Stride entities shown with the globe.&#xD;&#xA;Cursor is the mouse in projection space, for ScreenToGlobe; View for GlobeViewInfo and the navigation nodes." Tags="renderer,window,globe,map">
